/* 注册页：品牌区/卡片/输入框复用登录页那套实测样式，仅补注册特有的两个按钮与验证码行。 */
@import "../login/login.wxss";

/* ── 验证码行：输入框 + 发送按钮 ── */
.reg-code-row {
  display: flex;
  align-items: flex-start;
  gap: 8px;
}

.reg-code-input {
  flex: 1;
  min-width: 0;
}

.reg-code-btn {
  flex-shrink: 0;
  height: 32px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 0 12px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  color: #1447e6;
  font-size: 13px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 20px;
}

.reg-code-btn-off {
  color: #94a3b8;
}

/* ── 底部两个按钮 ── */
.reg-actions {
  margin-top: 12px;
  padding: 16px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.reg-btn-main {
  width: 100%;
  height: 32px;
  margin-top: 0;
  border-radius: 10px;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 20px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
}

.reg-bindbtn {
  width: 100%;
  height: 32px;
  margin-top: 12px;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  gap: 6px;
  border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
  border-radius: 10px;
  background-color: #ffffff;
  color: #15803d;
  font-size: 14px;
  font-weight: 500;
  line-height: 20px;
}

.reg-wxicon {
  width: 18px;
  height: 18px;
}

.reg-bindbtn-off {
  opacity: 0.5;
}
